  src: '{"name":"kevin_armchair","prefab":"Assets/Models/PolyHaven/modern_arm_chair_01.glb","x":[10.41,11.09],"z":[3.871,4.701],"y0":0.0,"height":0.85,"back":"","collide":true,"source":"props lane (Kevin+Jeff TRIAL 1 Oct 18, changes/2026-10-18-kevin-room.json; spec/dressing/kevin.json): Marina 365 s: a pale grey upholstered chair with dark wooden arms in the corner by the dresser-side front window. Poly Haven ArmChair_01 (CC0) fitted to the box (hifi_kevin.py re-exports it). Not in the film''s shots. Yaw 180 pinned after the build-1 front render (yaw 0 faced the wall). Oct 18 dressing round: ArmChair_01 (a Victorian bergere) swapped for Poly Haven modern_arm_chair_01 (CC0; 0.82 x 0.99 x 1.02 at 0.83 = 0.68 x 0.83 x 0.85): Marina 355/365''s mid-century chair with flat wooden arms; its seat is black leather where Marina''s is pale grey (colour miss, tint can''t lighten it).","floor":"upper","hides":[],"yaw":180}'
